cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BeamSolver in academic work, please cite this software."
title: "BeamSolver"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sizov"
    given-names: "Dmitry"
    affiliation: "Nazarbayev University"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-21"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  BeamSolver is a Wolfram Language package for analytical solution of
  statically determinate Euler-Bernoulli beam problems. It computes support
  reactions and analytical expressions for shear force, bending moment,
  rotation angle, and deflection for combinations of concentrated forces,
  concentrated moments, and uniformly distributed loads.
keywords:
  - "Wolfram Language"
  - "Euler-Bernoulli beam"
  - "beam analysis"
  - "structural mechanics"
  - "symbolic computation"
